  "joint_plan_text": "### Joint Plan — mat_complex  (about 5 min / deadline 15 min: OK)\n### Robots: R1:Gripper(kitchen), R2:Mobile_Light(kitchen), R3:Mobile_Heavy(kitchen), R4:Gripper(kitchen)\n\n\n[0-5 min]\n- R1 [LOCAL] pick up the egg from the counter to the gripper  (r1_s1)\n- R4 [LOCAL] slice the red tomato from the gripper to the counter  (r4_s2)\n- R1 [LOCAL] place the egg from the gripper to the white plate  (r1_s2)\n- R4 [LOCAL] place the sliced red tomato from the counter to the white plate  (r4_s4)\n- R1 [LOCAL] open the microwave door from closed to open  (r1_s5)\n- R1 [LOCAL] close the microwave door from open to closed  (r1_s7)\n- R1 [LOCAL] toggle the microwave from off to on  (r1_s8)",
  "joint_plan_full": "### Joint Plan — mat_complex  (about 5 min / deadline 15 min: OK)\n### Robots: R1:Gripper(kitchen), R2:Mobile_Light(kitchen), R3:Mobile_Heavy(kitchen), R4:Gripper(kitchen)\n\n\n[0-5 min]\n- R1 [LOCAL] pick_up the egg from counter to gripper  (r1_s1)\n- R4 [LOCAL] slice the red tomato from gripper to counter  (r4_s2)\n- R1 [LOCAL] place the egg from gripper to white plate  (r1_s2)\n- R4 [LOCAL] place the sliced red tomato from counter to white plate  (r4_s4)\n- R1 [LOCAL] open the microwave door from closed to open  (r1_s5)\n- R1 [LOCAL] close the microwave door from open to closed  (r1_s7)\n- R1 [LOCAL] toggle the microwave from off to on  (r1_s8)\n\n### Dropped\n- R2 [LOCAL] pick_up the white plate from counter to gripper — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 and R4 already handling the white plate. R2's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R4 [LOCAL] pick_up the red tomato from counter to gripper — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 who handles the tomato. R4's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R4 [LOCAL] pick_up the white plate from counter to gripper — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 already handling the white plate. R4's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R1 [LOCAL] pick_up the tomato from counter to gripper — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R4 who handles the tomato slicing. R1's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R3 [LOCAL] open the microwave door from closed to open — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 already opening the microwave door. R3's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R2 [LOCAL] place the white plate from gripper to microwave — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 already placing the plate in the microwave. R2's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R3 [LOCAL] close the microwave door from open to closed — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 already closing the microwave door. R3's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R2 [LOCAL] toggle the microwave from off to on — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 already toggling the microwave. R2's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R3 [LOCAL] place the white plate containing egg and tomato from counter to microwave — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 who handles placing the plate in the microwave. R3's action is redundant. (by graph)\n- R1 [LOCAL] place the tomato from gripper to white plate — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R4 who is responsible for placing the sliced tomato on the plate. R1's action is unnecessary. (by graph)\n- R1 [LOCAL] place the white plate from counter to microwave — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R3 who was initially responsible for placing the plate in the microwave, but since R3's action was dropped, R1's action should be retained. (by graph)\n- R3 [LOCAL] toggle the microwave from off to on — graph: DUPLICATE_WORK with R1 who will toggle the microwave. R3's action is redundant. (by graph)",
